          "title": "Load-Bearing Context: The Question Damage Score for Evaluating Context Reliance in Linguistic Reasoning",
          "title_zh": "承重上下文：用于评估语言推理中上下文依赖的问题损伤分数",
          "url": "http://arxiv.org/abs/2608.27756v1",
          "source": "arXiv",
          "section": "arxiv_other",
          "organization": "",
          "language": "en",
          "arxiv_id": "2608.27756",
          "summary": "Introduces a diagnostic framework that deletes single context examples from 53 UK Linguistics Olympiad puzzles, either uniformly at random or targeted at a structurally load-bearing example, and scores the impact with a Question Damage Score that classifies puzzles as fragile or robust. Evaluating three frontier LLMs under instructions to abstain when information is insufficient, the authors find the models rarely abstain and often still produce correct answers after load-bearing context is removed.",
          "keywords": [
